    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Integrate with Moova to get same-day shipping at affordable rates. This extension allows clients from Uruguay, Argentina, Mexico, Chile, Peru, Guatemala, and Panama to automate their shippings.</p>\n<p>The main features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Live Shipping Rate: Based on the product weight, box dimensions, shipping origin, destination, etc., this plugin fetches Moova rates for shipping services.</li>\n<li>Real-time tracking: We provide a tracking number that enables your client to see all the shipping status from our website. We also notify all the shipping status to your store.</li>\n<li>Shipments in 24 hours: Improve the user experience by enabling our 24-hour shipping. We give a label for all shippings automatically and ready to print.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Use the Settings-&gt;Moova screen to configure the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>3.0</h4>\n<p>Dynamic text<br />\nDynamic images<br />\nImprove hooks and text</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Plugin to connect Moova&#039;s Shipping services with WooCommerce",
    "description": "<p>Integrate with Moova to get same-day shipping at affordable rates. This extension allows clients from Uruguay, Argentina, Mexico, Chile, Peru, Guatemala, and Panama to automate their shippings.</p>\n<p>The main features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Live Shipping Rate: Based on the product weight, box dimensions, shipping origin, destination, etc., this plugin fetches Moova rates for shipping services.</li>\n<li>Real-time tracking: We provide a tracking number that enables your client to see all the shipping status from our website. We also notify all the shipping status to your store.</li>\n<li>Shipments in 24 hours: Improve the user experience by enabling our 24-hour shipping. We give a label for all shippings automatically and ready to print.</li>\n</ul>\n",
